-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Mit Eurem Edelmut und Eurer Heldenhaftigkeit erweist Ihr mir Ehre, $n.$B$BUnd auch ihnen habt Ihr Ehre erwiesen...", Details AC enUS : "You have honored me with your nobility and heroism, $N.$B$BYou have also honored them..." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have honored me with your nobility and heroism, $n.$b$bYou have also honored them..."
