-- AC datas : OLD Title : "Besudelte Rune", Title AC enUS : "Tainted Memorandum" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tainted Memorandum",  OLD Objectives : "Lest die besudelte Rune und sprecht mit Saripal Schmauchbräu in Ambossar oberhalb des Eisklammtals.", Objectives AC enUS : "Read the Tainted Memorandum and speak to Alamar Grimm inside Anvilmar above Coldridge Valley." ; Wowhead enUS : "Read the Tainted Memorandum and speak to Alamar Grimm inside Anvilmar above Coldridge Valley.",  OLD Details : "Während Ihr unterwegs wart, um mir zu helfen, wurde mir dieses Memorandum für Euch gegeben. Nehmt Euch die Zeit, es zu lesen, wenn Ihr die Gelegenheit dazu habt. Ich glaube, es kommt vom Hexenmeisterlehrerin Saripal. Werft einen Blick darauf und sucht ihn dann in Ambossar auf, sobald Ihr die Gelegenheit dazu habt.$B$BUnd passt auf Euch auf, $n, man traut Leuten wie Euch hierzulande nicht gerade.", Details AC enUS : "While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warlock trainer Alamar. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.$B$BAnd watch yerself, $N, your kind ain't too trusted 'round these parts." ; Wowhead enUS : "While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warlock trainer Alamar. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.$b$bAnd watch yerself, $n, your kind ain't too trusted 'round these parts."
