ss and then strike.$b$bThat, however, is not why we are here now. The All Seeing Eye has been lost - taken by the Winterax trolls of the region.$b$bRecover the Eye and our services shall be yours - for whatever time remains for your side.$b$bReturn to me once you acquire the eye so that I may examine you.$b$b<Master Ryson grins.>"
