-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Das ist ja eine unglaubliche Geschichte, $n! Seid Euch meines Dankes gewiss, und der aufrichtigen Dankbarkeit all derer, die in dieses Abenteuer verwickelt waren. Vielleicht kann ich nun endlich wieder mit geschlossenen Augen schlafen.$B$BNun zu Eurer Belohnung. Ich habe hier einige Dinge, an denen Ihr gewiss Gefallen finden werdet.", Details AC enUS : "That's an amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy." ; Wowhead enUS : "That's an amazing story, $n! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.$b$bAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy."
