-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Gesucht: tot oder lebendig$B$BZorbo der Berater, gesucht für mehrere geplante Angriffe auf Garadar. Zusammen mit seinen Häschern und Schamanen hat Zorbo unzählige Orcs getötet. Zorbo ist als bewaffnet, gefährlich und erbarmungslos einzustufen.$B$BSein Zuhause befindet sich in den Ruinen des Lachenden Schädels in den nördlichen Bergen von Nagrand.$B$BDie Belohnung für den Tod oder die Gefangennahme von Zorbo dem Berater wird von Aufseher Bullrok in Garadar ausbezahlt.", Details AC enUS : "Wanted: Dead or Alive$B$BZorbo the Advisor, wanted for numerous planned attacks on Garadar. Along with his reavers and shaman, Zorbo has slain countless orcs. Consider Zorbo as armed, dangerous, and merciless.$B$BZorbo makes his home in the Laughing Skull Ruins in the northern mountains of Nagrand.$B$BReward for Zorbo the Advisor's death or capture to be dispensed by Warden Bullrok at Garadar. " ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Dead or Alive$b$bZorbo the Advisor, wanted for numerous planned attacks on Garadar. Along with his reavers and shaman, Zorbo has slain countless orcs. Consider Zorbo as armed, dangerous, and merciless.$b$bZorbo makes his home in the Laughing Skull Ruins in the northern mountains of Nagrand.$b$bReward for Zorbo the Advisor's death or capture to be dispensed by Warden Bullrok at Garadar.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Zorbo the Advisor slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warmaul Shaman slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warmaul Reaver slain"
