ut your help, I would have been stuck here for all eternity. Now, I will take over your body and you will destroy my captors and break these bonds. Refuse and we will both be stuck here forever.$B$BTeron Gorefiend will be free!" ; Wowhead enUS : "With Gorefiend's items restored, there is but one last piece to this puzzle: A host.$b$b<The ancient shadowmoon spirit's lips curl up to form a wicked grin.>$b$bSurely you did not believe the fairy tale that I told you. The Altar of Shadows is my prison. Without your help, I would have been stuck here for all eternity. Now, I will take over your body and you will destroy my captors and break these bonds. Refuse and we will both be stuck here forever.$b$bTeron Gorefiend will be free!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Karsius the Ancient Watcher slain"
