-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Ihr habt Euren Pfad gewählt, $C. Jetzt ist es an Euch, ihm zu folgen - wo immer er Euch auch hinführen möge.$B$BIhr werdet herausfinden, dass es seine Vorteile hat, Freunde unter den Erzmagiern von Dalaran zu haben. Dient uns wohl und Eure Taten werden nicht unbelohnt bleiben.", Details AC enUS : "You've chosen your path, $c.  Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.$B$BYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages.  Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "You've chosen your path, $c. Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.$b$bYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages. Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Violet Eye"
