-- AC datas : OLD Title : "Verdammte Kaninchen!", Title AC enUS : "Waskily Wabbits!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Waskily Wabbits!",  OLD Objectives : "Sammelt 10 unglückbringende Hasenpfoten.", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 10 Unlucky Wabbit Feet from the Waskily Wabbits." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 5 rabbits and return to Jon LeCraft by the forge on Designer Island.",  OLD Details : "Diese Hasen vermehren sich wie... die Karnickel!$B$BZieht los und erlegt ein paar für mich!", Details AC enUS : "These rabbits are breeding uncontrollably.  Something must be done!$b$bHelp us $n, you're our only hope." ; Wowhead enUS : "These rabbits are breeding uncontrollably. Something must be done!$b$bHelp us $n, you're our only hope."
